# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day17

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| obtain | 얻다 | Researchers obtained useful data. |
| consume | 소비하다 | Humans consume energy every day. |
| generate | 생성하다 | Solar panels generate electricity. |

---

## Synonyms

obtain
→ acquire / gain

consume
→ use / spend

generate
→ produce / create

